  "details": "Description\n\nEvery time I launch VRChat or return to my home world, I receive a fake invite notification. The same invite keeps repeating over and over, even after I dismiss it. This happens every time I launch VRChat or go back home.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLaunch VRChat and enter any world.\n\nReturn to your Home world or restart VRChat.\n\nA fake invite notification appears.\n\nDismiss the invite and repeat step 2.\n\nThe same fake invite appears again every time.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
